<title>USA: Nassau Cty, N.Y., won by Goldman at 5.171 pct NIC.</title>
<headline>Nassau Cty, N.Y., won by Goldman at 5.171 pct NIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Wednesday it won $89.9 million Nassau County, N.Y., unlimited tax bonds at a net interest cost of 5.171 percent.</p>
</text>
